    "reliably surfaces a stable set of HTTP-layer header / cookie",
    "alerts. This fixture validates that the secscan DAST path",
    "generalizes beyond Juice Shop — a second 3rd-party target.",
    "Match logic: secscan Finding.rule_id == ZAP pluginid."
  ],
  "expected_findings": [
